Beverage Products
Below are some of the beverages we have the capacity and capability to make.
#### Non-Alcoholic Beverages
These non-alcoholic products include: non-alcoholic mocktails, non-alcoholic spirits, non-alcoholic cordials and liqueurs, non-alcoholic beer, zero proof beverages, alcohol free wines and RTD cocktail mixers.
#### Functional Beverages
Functional beverages include: energy drinks, sports drinks, isotonics, functional juices, and functional waters. We can also copack powdered functional products like superfood powders, and meal replacements and other powdered functional products.
#### Alcoholic Beverages
These alcohol beverages include: both distilled and fermented beverages like: spirits, liqueurs, beers, wines, sparkling wines, hard ciders, and malt beverages. Our beverage capabilities also include cream liqueurs and emulsified alcoholic beverages.
#### Nutraceutical Beverages
Nutraceutical beverages include those that promote wellness and ultimate well being. Nutraceutical products would be ones that contain: ginseng, echinacea, green tea, omega-3, ginger, and turmeric. These products could be packed in capsules, powders, soft gels or stick packs.
#### Coffee and Tea Beverages
Coffee beverage products include instant, decaffeinated, cold brew and regular extracts. The tea options include black, green, white, rooibos, oolong, and chamomile. Tea types can be regular, decaf, organic and fair trade.
Water copacking
#### Juices, Waters, Milk and Dairy Alternatives
These products include: fruit and vegetable juices, flavored waters, sparkling water, spring water, and other premium waters, vitamin enhanced water, sodas, dairy cream bases, plant based beverages, creamers and dairy alternatives
#### Powdered Products
We can formulate and co-pack your beverage product in powdered form. Most beverages are able to be formulated in powdered form. A powdered product is also easier to send and ship for on-line distribution.
#### Other Speciality Beverages
Some other beverages we've worked to formulate and co-pack include kombucha, hop water, and CBD related products. CBD and THC products available in ready to drink or powders. If you don't see a beverage product on our list, contact us to see if we have the capability to make it.
Beverage Flavoring and Formulation
Big Brands has a team of Food and Beverage Scientists to formulate the recipe for your product. We take your concept and create a custom recipe that will make your product stand out above the competition. Having a properly formulated product is one of the most important factors for the success of your beverage. Our team will work with you each step of the way to achieve that goal. We have successfully launched hundreds of products to the market.
### Chocolate functional bars, gummies, lozenges, and homeopathic sprays
Looking for another way to deliver nutritional products to your customers? Big Brands also formulate and manufacturers nutritional, supplemental and homeopathic products. We are ready to assist you with developing all of your nutritional products.
