#### Functional Beverages
Functional beverages include: energy drinks, sports drinks, isotonics, functional juices, and functional waters. We can also copack powdered functional products like superfood powders, and meal replacements and other powdered functional products.
#### Alcoholic Beverages
These alcohol beverages include: both distilled and fermented beverages like: spirits, liqueurs, beers, wines, sparkling wines, hard ciders, and malt beverages. Our beverage capabilities also include cream liqueurs and emulsified alcoholic beverages.
#### Nutraceutical Beverages
Nutraceutical beverages include those that promote wellness and ultimate well being. Nutraceutical products would be ones that contain: ginseng, echinacea, green tea, omega-3, ginger, and turmeric. These products could be packed in capsules, powders, soft gels or stick packs.
#### Coffee and Tea Beverages
